  "description": "The tale of Snow White, re-invented! \n\nLearning her stepmother had been trying to kill her for the last ten years, Yi Hwa flees from the palace for her life. She desperately searches for Sa-eon, firmly believing he will help her out... But when she finally finds him, he flat out refuses to take her in, as he has enough of a hard time trying to support his six siblings. No matter how much Yi Hwa pleads with him, Sa-eon's answer is an unwavering \"no\" - an answer which she, of course, refuses to accept! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue*",
